&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Masterful Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of presenting to and influencing executive-level stakeholders, with the ability to translate complex technical challenges into clear business impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency with iterative development methodologies and modern project management tooling (Jira, Linear, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; An insatiable appetite for learning and deeply engaging with modern ML/GenAI practices and infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
